{"unit_id":"tag:00W1:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n为了定义层化（sheafification），我们研究覆盖（covering）的零阶 <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech 上同调（cohomology）群（group）及其函子性（functoriality）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为 <MATH_0002> 上的集合（sets）值预层（presheaf），并设 <MATH_0003> 为 <MATH_0004> 的一个覆盖（covering）。我们用记号 <MATH_0005> 表示等化子（equalizer）\n<MATH_0006>\n正如后面将看到的，这是零阶 <GROUPOPEN_0002><ACCENT_0002><GROUPCLOSE_0002>ech 上同调（cohomology），对应于 <MATH_0007> 在 <MATH_0008> 上相对于覆盖（covering）<MATH_0009> 的情形。一个小（small）注记是，只要所有态射（morphisms）<MATH_0011> 都是可表的（representable），就可以定义 <MATH_0010>，即 <MATH_0012> 不必是该位点（site）的覆盖（covering）。有一个典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0013>。显然，覆盖（coverings）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0014> 诱导交换图（commutative diagrams）\n<MATH_0015>\n这进而产生映射（map）<MATH_0016>，与映射（map）<MATH_0017> 相容。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n由构造，预层（presheaf）<MATH_0018> 是层（sheaf），当且仅当对于 <MATH_0019> 作为 <MATH_0020> 的每个覆盖（covering），自然的映射（map）<MATH_0021> 都是双射的（bijective）。我们将用这一概念证明下面关于层（sheaves）的极限（limits）的简单引理。\n\n","allowed_english":["ech"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"functoriality","target_term":"函子性"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagrams","target