{"unit_id":"tag:00W2:statement","translation":"<LOCKED_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为图表（diagram）。则 <MATH_0002> 存在，并且等于预层（presheaves）范畴（category）中的极限（limit）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表","context":"层范畴中的图表"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"比较极限所在的预层范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"预层范畴"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限","context":"图表在预层范畴中的极限"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00W2:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为预层（presheaf）意义下的极限（limit）。我们将证明它是层（sheaf），于是它在层（sheaves）范畴（category）中也是极限（limit），这一点就直接得到。为证明层性质（sheaf property），取覆盖（covering）<MATH_0002>。设 <MATH_0003> 为 <MATH_0004> 的一个元素（element）。利用投影（projection）映射（maps），我们得到元素（elements）<MATH_0005>，位于 <MATH_0006> 中。由 <MATH_0007> 的层性质（sheaf property）可知，存在唯一的 <MATH_0008>，使得 <MATH_0009>。设 <MATH_0010> 为指标范畴（index category）的一个态射（morphism）。我们要说明，<MATH_0011> 将 <MATH_0012> 映射（maps）到 <MATH_0013>。我们知道，这对截面（sections）<MATH_0014> 和 <MATH_0015> 成立，对所有 <MATH_0016> 都如此，因此由 <MATH_0017> 的层性质（sheaf property）可知，所要说明的结论成立。此时我们有一个元素（element）<MATH_0018>，位于 <MATH_0019> 中。我们将验证这个元素（element）具有所需性质 <MATH_0020> 留给读者。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"},{"source_term":"index category","target_term":"指标范畴"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"先在预层范畴中构造极限"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限","context":"待证明为层的极限"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"极限满足层条件"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"层范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"层范畴"},{