{"unit_id":"tag:00W3:statement","translation":"一个特别的例子是空（empty）图表（diagram）上的极限（limit）。它给出（预）层（sheaves）范畴（category）中的终对象（final object）。这是这样一个预层（presheaf）：它将 <MATH_0001> 作为 <MATH_0002> 的每个对象（object），都对应到一个单元素（singleton）集合（set），其限制（restriction）映射（mappings）是唯一的；并且这个预层（presheaf）是层（sheaf）。我们常把这个层（sheaf）记为 <MATH_0003>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"singleton","target_term":"单元素"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"mappings","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空","context":"空指标图表"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表","context":"定义终对象的空图表"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限","context":"空图表的极限"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"原文的预层或层范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"预层或层的范畴"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"空极限给出的对象"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"处处取单元素集合的预层"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"位点中的对象"},{"source_term":"singleton","target_term":"单元素","context":"终预层的取值"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"终预层的取值集合"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"唯一的限制映射"},{"source_term":"mappings","target_term":"映射","context":"终预层的限制映射"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"终预层同时是层"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00W1:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为由 <MATH_0002> 的所有覆盖（coverings）组成的范畴（category）。换言之，<MATH_0003> 的对象（objects）是 <MATH_0004> 在 <MATH_0005> 中的覆盖（coverings），而态射（morphisms）是加细（refinements）。根据我们关于位点（sites）的约定，这确实是一个范畴（category），即对象（objects）和态射（morphisms）所成的总体是集合（set）。注意，<MATH_0006> 是非空的（not empty），因为 <MATH_0007> 是它的一个对象（object）。根据上面的注记，构造 <MATH_0008> 是 <MATH_0009> 上的反变函子（contravariant functor）。我们定义\n<MATH_0010>\n关于极限（limits）和余极限（colimits）的讨论，见范畴（Categories）第 <REF_0001> 节。我们指出，后面将看到 <MATH_0011> 是零阶 <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech 上同调（cohomology），对应于 <MATH_0012> 在 <MATH_0013> 上的情形。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n在进一步讨论余极限（colimit）的结构之前，我们先将这组集合（sets）<MATH_0014>，<MATH_0015>，变成一个预层（presheaf）。具体而言，设 <MATH_0016> 为 <MATH_0017> 的一个态射（morphism）。由位点（site）的公理，有一个函子（functor）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>这个构造实际上涉及纤维积（fibre products）<MATH_0018> 的选择，因此涉及选择公理（axiom of choice）。所得到的映射（map）不依赖于所作的选择，见下文。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>\n<MATH_0019>\n注意，投影（projection）映射（maps）给出一个具有函子性（functorial）的覆盖（coverings）态射（morphism）<MATH_0020>，因此由上面的构造，得到一个具有函子性（functorial）的集合（sets）映射（map）<MATH_0021>。换言之，有一个函子（functors）的变换（transformation），从 <MATH_0022> 到复合（composition）<MATH_0023>。因此，由余极限（colimits）的一般性质，我们得到典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0024>。用上面对集合（set）<MATH_0025> 的描述来说，它就是把与 <MATH_0026> 对应的元素（element），送到与 <MATH_0027> 对应的元素（element）。\n\n","allowed_english":["ech"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"refinements","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"not empty","target_term":"非空的"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"axiom of choice","target_term":"选择公理"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"固定对象的覆盖范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"覆盖构成的范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"覆盖范畴的对象"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"覆盖范畴中的态射"},{"source_term":"refinements","target_term":"加细","context":"覆盖范畴的态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"保证对象和态射总体为集合的约定"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"覆盖范畴的大小及加构造的取值"},{"source_term":"not empty","target_term":"非空的","context":"恒等覆盖保证覆盖范畴非空"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"恒等覆盖作为对象"},{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子","context":"覆盖到零阶上同调的构造"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限","context":"引用范畴章的极限讨论"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限","context":"加构造及其一般性质"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用范畴章"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"加构造给出零阶上同调"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限","context":"加构造的余极限结构"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"加构造的取值及取值间的映射"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"将加构造组织为预层"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"底范畴态射及覆盖态射"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"由位点公理拉回覆盖"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"拉回给出的覆盖范畴间函子"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"拉回覆盖所需的纤维积选择"},{"source_term":"axiom of choice","target_term":"选择公理","context":"选择纤维积所涉及的公理"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"加构造在底范畴态射上的作用"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影","context":"纤维积的投影"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"投影映射"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性","context":"覆盖态射及集合映射的函子性质"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"零阶上同调的两个函子"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换","context":"两个函子间的变换"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"先拉回再取零阶上同调的复合"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"余极限诱导的限制映射"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"加构造中的局部截面代表元"}],"notes":[]}
